\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The landscape of Performance Max has fundamentally changed. While PMax remains a powerful tool in your Google Ads arsenal, our testing with 100+ clients throughout 2025 has revealed a critical insight: 
\f0\b Performance Max campaigns naturally gravitate toward warm audience traffic and existing customers rather than true new customer acquisition.
\f1\b0 \
This discovery has led us to completely restructure how we approach PMax campaigns. Instead of treating PMax as your primary acquisition engine, we now position it as a sophisticated remarketing and middle-of-funnel campaign that works in tandem with dedicated cold traffic acquisition campaigns.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
